WEBVTT

00:03.670 --> 00:05.500
Usagi-chan?

00:07.000 --> 00:10.290
You should think about heading home soon!

00:10.290 --> 00:11.960
Right!

00:12.290 --> 00:14.380
Mom...

00:14.920 --> 00:17.210
It's been so long since I've heard her voice...

00:17.210 --> 00:19.920
Thanks for coming, Usagi-chan.

00:20.630 --> 00:25.170
You've been so helpful,
going out and looking for our son,

00:25.170 --> 00:28.170
then taking care of his plants...

00:28.540 --> 00:31.290
Oh, it's the least I could do.

00:31.580 --> 00:34.750
Wait... Tsukishiro did all that?

00:36.920 --> 00:39.880
Yosomi shinaide onrii wan na good boy

00:39.880 --> 00:43.040
Kimi to ireba wandafuru ranran raifu

00:43.040 --> 00:46.130
One, two, three de jump! Aijou atenshon

00:46.130 --> 00:49.210
Three, two, one de turn! Kitai ijou supaaku

00:49.210 --> 00:52.380
One to one de love! Gyakkyou furakushon

00:52.380 --> 00:55.460
Asa kara ban made wandafuru ni saabisu

00:55.460 --> 00:58.540
Daisuki datte tsutawatte little boy

00:58.540 --> 01:02.130
Aishite! Aishite! Aisasete I want you

01:02.710 --> 01:08.500
Boku o ikiro kanzen nenshou hashirinukero

01:08.500 --> 01:15.170
Gooru wa atarashii jibun sa
(Go Beyond Yourself!)

01:15.170 --> 01:20.960
Takaku hoero manshinsoui na kinou koete

01:20.960 --> 01:24.000
Ashita no (aijou atenshon)
bokura no (gyakkyou furakushon)

01:24.000 --> 01:28.210
Seiippai kagayaiteru

01:28.210 --> 01:29.710
This is your life, your way!

01:29.830 --> 01:31.380
This is my life, my way!

01:31.500 --> 01:32.380
Wan!

01:39.670 --> 01:41.960
Want me to drive you
so you don't have to walk in the rain?

01:40.250 --> 01:44.540
<b>A Lonely Rabbit.</b>

01:41.960 --> 01:44.130
Thanks, but I'll be okay!

01:44.830 --> 01:47.710
Being here's brought back some memories,

01:47.710 --> 01:50.790
so maybe I should head out with Tsukishiro...

01:51.830 --> 01:54.630
Okay, then... I'll be back soon.

01:54.630 --> 01:56.670
Walk home safe.

01:57.670 --> 02:04.170
And now I know how much
other people actually cared about me.

02:07.670 --> 02:10.500
I really do need to find a way back.

02:11.290 --> 02:14.000
I can't stay as a dog forever...

02:18.210 --> 02:21.630
Oh, no! I'm totally soaked!

02:21.630 --> 02:24.130
Down to my brand-new undies, too...

02:25.830 --> 02:28.500
I yelped, but she must not've heard me!

02:28.500 --> 02:31.420
Huh? Are you the dog I saw before?

02:33.040 --> 02:34.500
Oh, no!

02:36.080 --> 02:41.380
Aww, you're soaking wet!
You kinda remind me of Senpai, too.

02:42.580 --> 02:48.540
See? You're so sad and sweet,
and you look like you're really dumb...

02:57.380 --> 02:59.290
Don't worry, now.

03:01.130 --> 03:04.500
I'll give you a nice, loving home.

03:05.710 --> 03:08.790
Shoot, Tsukishiro's gonna take me with her!

03:10.710 --> 03:13.080
Wait, is that Inukai-san and Nekotani?!

03:13.080 --> 03:15.170
Are they looking for me?

03:16.330 --> 03:19.380
Dammit, the rain's too loud!

03:19.380 --> 03:21.830
Huh? Why are you barking?

03:21.830 --> 03:23.580
Are you cold?

03:23.580 --> 03:28.710
Come home with me
and I'll help you get dry!

03:30.000 --> 03:32.790
Nekotani! Inukai-san!

03:32.790 --> 03:35.830
C'mon! Hello!

03:36.000 --> 03:37.830
Help!

03:39.960 --> 03:41.920
I'm home!

03:45.080 --> 03:48.210
She actually took me home...

03:51.710 --> 03:54.750
So, she's seriously gonna adopt me?!

03:56.500 --> 04:01.130
Here we are! This is my room...

04:04.920 --> 04:06.170
Tsukishiro?!

04:06.170 --> 04:08.290
Hey, Tsukishiro, you okay?!

04:14.000 --> 04:16.000
Tsukishiro, you doing okay?!

04:16.170 --> 04:17.920
Oh, geez, she's burning up.

04:17.920 --> 04:25.000
Did she get sick from being out in the rain
and carrying me home?

04:25.000 --> 04:27.000
She can't stay like this...

04:27.290 --> 04:30.000
I've gotta get her out of those wet clothes!

04:44.250 --> 04:45.920
It's stuck on something!

05:00.330 --> 05:02.880
How the hell do I get her bra off?!

05:04.500 --> 05:06.460
Senpai...

05:08.210 --> 05:11.380
I'm so tired...

05:11.380 --> 05:15.290
From looking for you,
and watering your plants...

05:16.330 --> 05:19.170
Tsukishiro's getting loopy...

05:19.920 --> 05:23.420
I've been too worried... To even sleep...

05:24.040 --> 05:27.330
She was that worried about me?

05:27.920 --> 05:31.460
Senpai, I...

05:33.920 --> 05:36.630
I'm not letting her get any worse!

05:36.630 --> 05:39.670
I gotta get her warmed up, and fast!

05:40.710 --> 05:42.210
Why?

05:43.380 --> 05:46.580
Okay, just gotta get this clasp undone!

05:52.790 --> 05:56.210
Why don't you get jealous
when I talk to other senpais?

05:58.170 --> 06:01.920
I want you to get jealous!

06:12.130 --> 06:13.330
Huh?

06:14.790 --> 06:16.830
Sorry, Tsukishiro!

06:28.580 --> 06:31.790
I just want you...

06:31.790 --> 06:34.500
to pay attention to me!

06:35.330 --> 06:38.380
Gotta keep my eyes from wandering too high...

06:38.880 --> 06:44.500
I'm pretty thrilled to hear she's had
the hots for me all this time...

06:44.830 --> 06:47.710
But now I've gotta focus!

06:47.710 --> 06:52.290
I've gotta this girl out of her wet underwear!

06:52.500 --> 06:54.130
God dammit!

06:55.170 --> 06:57.170
Don't look, don't look...

06:59.130 --> 07:01.960
Almost there! I got this!

07:27.420 --> 07:29.790
Just a little more!

07:33.080 --> 07:35.000
Yes, got 'em!

07:35.880 --> 07:37.710
Senpai...

07:37.710 --> 07:40.380
don't look, I'm...

07:40.380 --> 07:42.170
not ready...

07:42.170 --> 07:46.290
Oh, c'mon! I shouldn't be staring!

07:47.790 --> 07:50.790
Time to get her into some clothes!

07:53.750 --> 07:57.040
Made it to Tsukishiro's room.

08:00.750 --> 08:02.710
It smells like poppies...

08:05.670 --> 08:08.880
This is totally what I'd imagine
a girly room to look like...

08:11.000 --> 08:12.500
C'mon, get focused!

08:12.880 --> 08:15.540
I gotta find something for her to wear!

08:15.540 --> 08:17.250
Just gotta look...

08:20.500 --> 08:21.920
There we go!

08:23.540 --> 08:25.500
Senpai!

08:26.080 --> 08:29.290
Oh, geez... How do I do this?

08:29.750 --> 08:32.290
How am I supposed to get her dressed

08:32.290 --> 08:34.500
when she's plopped down
on the floor like this?

08:35.170 --> 08:37.540
No thoughts, head empty!

08:37.540 --> 08:41.580
Just get her into
whatever you can get her into!

08:42.290 --> 08:46.880
Okay, let's start by getting her covered up!

08:55.710 --> 08:58.420
That's the most I can do
with paws and teeth...

08:58.710 --> 09:02.170
But I can't just let her lie here
with her privates all exposed...

09:02.500 --> 09:04.710
I gotta at least get her to wear some undies.

09:07.290 --> 09:09.210
Sweet, let's do this!

09:10.380 --> 09:12.000
Senpai!

09:16.290 --> 09:18.130
I got them off.

09:18.130 --> 09:20.170
I should be able to get them on!

09:21.000 --> 09:22.330
Come on!

09:22.330 --> 09:25.880
Oh, God, Senpai, you're so hard!

09:25.880 --> 09:27.250
Yes!

09:31.420 --> 09:33.000
Almost there!

09:34.380 --> 09:37.830
Senpai! I love you, I love you!

09:37.830 --> 09:39.250
Give it to me!

09:43.500 --> 09:45.580
Yes! I did it!

09:47.630 --> 09:50.670
She should be good now.

09:50.670 --> 09:53.040
I just gotta find someone to help...

10:00.670 --> 10:04.960
Hello? Sorry to bother you,
but we're looking for a dog...

10:05.250 --> 10:07.750
Whoa, they left the door open.

10:09.460 --> 10:11.920
Huh? You sure we should be doing this?

10:11.920 --> 10:13.330
We're coming in!

10:21.670 --> 10:23.460
Inukai-san?!

10:23.460 --> 10:25.920
Hello? Is anyone home?

10:43.130 --> 10:44.710
What a moment...

10:45.330 --> 10:48.420
Inukai-san, who's in love with me
in dog form...

10:49.710 --> 10:52.880
And Tsukishiro, who's in love with me
in human form...

10:58.330 --> 11:00.040
...meeting face to face!

11:03.040 --> 11:06.790
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

11:07.830 --> 11:10.420
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

11:10.420 --> 11:12.670
Let's go mai hausu!

11:12.830 --> 11:17.250
Airashii sono sugata ni sukitte sukitte tomaranai

11:17.250 --> 11:22.420
Watashi ga katte shiawase ni
suru kara kocchi oide yo

11:22.420 --> 11:26.540
Kyawakyawa chu chu chu himitsu no hitotoki wa

11:26.920 --> 11:31.580
Suki na mono ni massugu fureaeru daiji na jikan

11:31.960 --> 11:34.130
Shitawatteru kono kimochi

11:34.500 --> 11:36.500
Kakushiteta kono kimochi

11:37.040 --> 11:38.880
Mitsuketa kono kimochi

11:38.880 --> 11:40.540
Todoke! Todoke!

11:40.540 --> 11:42.540
Da-da-da-da-da-da-da daisuki!

11:42.540 --> 11:46.250
Kataomoi kimi ni kitto tsutawarimasu you ni

11:46.420 --> 11:50.630
Sono shigai kara miageta watashi ga itsuka

11:50.630 --> 11:53.170
Kimi no numbaa wan ni naritai

11:53.170 --> 11:56.040
Kokoro no soko kara I love you!
